     "titulo": "Reading: preparing a trip",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "安排「路线与旅行经历」相关的行程时，要同时考虑路线、交通和住宿。",
       "alumno": "When organising «routes and travel experiences», you have to consider the route, the transport and the accommodation all at once.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "提前确认信息，可以减少临时改变计划带来的麻烦。",
       "alumno": "Confirming information in advance helps avoid the trouble of last-minute changes to plans.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "先把问题说清楚，再举一个例子，最后说明自己的想法。",
       "alumno": "First state the problem, then give an example, and finish by explaining your opinion.",
       "literal": "",
